    "title": "Neku: OC character creator",
    "description": "Discover your unique style with NeKu \u2013 the ultimate social network profile icon creator! Design your own hand-drawn cartoon face and craft a personalized avatar that truly reflects your personality. With over 3000 dress-up parts at your fingertips, the possibilities are endless!\r\n\r\nUnleash your creativity as you mix and match fashionable clothing, accessories, eyes, haircuts, and backgrounds. Whether you aspire to be a fashion icon, a trendsetting creator, or a gallant knight, NeKu lets you bring your imagination to life!\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n- Customize your avatar with unlimited creativity.\r\n- Mix and match over 3000 dress-up parts to create your perfect look.\r\n- Easy-to-use interface with rich details and various styles to choose from.\r\n- Connect with like-minded individuals and make new friends who share your interests.\r\n\r\nJoin the NeKu community today and experience the excitement of avatar creation like never before! Let your creativity shine and express yourself in style!",
